  "name": "Zul'Gurub: Mar'li's Drain Life reaches a third of the raid, and Infest is Ascended only",
  "contract": [
    "On live Mar'li's (14510) Drain Life drained 16 of 25 players at once; the tester asked to meet in the",
    "middle, so each Drain Life (2118105) adds 2118106 on 0.32 of the players within 100 yards, rounded, besides",
    "its target: one of four. Festering spiderlings from Infest (2118151) belong to Ascended only (round-5",
    "tester): the Ascended Mar'li infests 87 s into the fight and the Mythic one does not. A group of four",
    "fights a Normal Mar'li; a Mythic and an Ascended hero each fight one alone. The world's eggs (179985) share",
    "phase 1 and the fixture lives in the lane's own phase, so each solo hero places three untimed eggs after",
    "her Mar'li's third Hatch Eggs (2118115). No Spawn of Mar'li (15041) appears on Mythic before the next",
    "Hatch Eggs, which then hatches the placed eggs: an Infest would have found a free egg."
  ],
